<title>USA: Toys R Us completes Baby Superstore acquisition.</title>
<headline>Toys R Us completes Baby Superstore acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>PARAMUS, N.J. 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Toys R Us Inc completed its acquisition of Baby Superstore Inc.</p>
<p>In October 1996, Toys R Us said it would acquire Baby Superstore in a tax-free exchange of shares valued at approximately $376 million.</p>
<p>The merger adds 77 stores to the Toys R Us family.</p>
</text>
